WHY: the Opus pass-2 seat BUILT ten mutants that scored 37/37 on table 1's instrument, nine changing a guest outcome
(../../opus_p2_20260914/table_p2*.out, disc_*.out, split_*.out): no row stored at len 4/8, none made a wide access at a
